        <mxCell id="n5" value="GENERIC LOOPS (archetypes, use-case free)&#xa;R1 Value engagement engine: base &#8594; throughput &#8594; co-creation &#8594; need satisfaction &#8594; relationship &#8594; engagement &#8594; base&#xa;B1 Actor pool saturation: base &#8722;&#8594; pool &#8594; engagement &#8594; base&#xa;R2 Capability reinvestment: base &#8594; resources &#8594; capacity &#8594; quality &#8594; satisfaction &#8594; ... &#8594; base&#xa;B2 Service overload: throughput &#8722;&#8594; quality &#8594; satisfaction &#8594; ... &#8594; base &#8594; throughput&#xa;B3 Co-destruction drag: throughput &#8594; co-destruction &#8722;&#8594; satisfaction &#8594; ... &#8594; throughput&#xa;B4 Ecological source limit: throughput &#8594; extraction &#8722;&#8594; biophysical stock &#8594; ecosystem services &#8594; capacity &#8594; ... &#8594; throughput&#xa;R3 Regenerative reinvestment: resources &#8594; regeneration &#8594; biophysical stock &#8594; ecosystem services &#8594; capacity &#8594; ... &#8594; resources&#xa;B5 Governance goal-seeking: benefits &#8722;&#8594; goal gap &#8594; governance &#8594; capacity/regeneration &#8594; ... &#8594; benefits&#xa;R4 Legitimacy: benefits &#8594; societal legitimacy &#8594; engagement &#8594; base &#8594; ... &#8594; benefits" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
