        <mxCell id="n6" value="LEGEND (variable colour = source FBMC block group)&#xa;BLUE = People (Actors, Stakeholders, Needs, Relationships, Channels)&#xa;AMBER = Value (Co-Creations, Co-Destructions, Products/Services)&#xa;PURPLE = Process (Resources, Activities, Partnerships)&#xa;GREEN = Environment (Biophysical Stocks, Ecosystem Services, Society context)&#xa;DARK RED = Outcomes &amp; Governance (Costs, Benefits, Goals, Governance)&#xa;[Block &#8226; sdTypeHint] shown under each variable. Every FBMC block of the canvas is represented &#8212; coverage invariant I2 satisfied by construction." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
